{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "KiLLPaKu!",
    "steam_appid": 3046510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>This work is a game created at Byking Co., Ltd.'s training for new employees.<br>It may not work properly depending on your PC environment.<br>Also, unintended problems may occur in the game.<br>please note that.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>\u25a0What is &quot;Killpaku!&quot;?<br>A 3D action game where you control Bebe, a gluttonous monster.<br>Aim at the weak points of the fighting &quot;onis&quot; and deal the final blow!<br>Literally, enjoy picking the best parts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/b660bf9e1ff42e2888f6aea01b7ebfc1.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br><br>\u25a0Three types of \u201ccopying\u201d, \u201cpredation\u201d, \u201cstealing\u201d, and \u201cimitation\u201d<br><br>Make full use of the 3 actions to earn more scores within the 3 minute time limit!<br>Eat as much as you can to avoid being defeated and aim for S rank!<br><br>\u25a0The first \u201crip-off\u201d and \u201cpredation\u201d<br>It can extend its tongue to eat weakened prey.<br>There are two ways to eat, one is to eat quickly in a straight line, and the other is to eat in batches while rotating.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/8d77f5a80e572a517920df35315ffd0f.poster.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/8d77f5a80e572a517920df35315ffd0f.webm?t=1743408901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/8d77f5a80e572a517920df35315ffd0f.mp4?t=1743408901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Second \u201crip-off\u201d and \u201cstealing\u201d<br>It is the act of finding a weakened enemy and taking the final blow from the prey.<br>If the timing is right, you can &quot;predate&quot;.<br>Move around so as not to be defeated, and aim for the enemies whose health bar is yellow and prey on them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/61a38bc09a75e0524392abe186b5fd01.poster.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/61a38bc09a75e0524392abe186b5fd01.webm?t=1743408901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/61a38bc09a75e0524392abe186b5fd01.mp4?t=1743408901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Third \u201ccopying\u201d and \u201cimitation\u201d<br>You can change the color by passing through puddles scattered throughout the game.<br>Let's blend in with the herd of oni and prey safely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/53b3d32ce8c86c7de3dcd9c3fe992ea9.poster.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/53b3d32ce8c86c7de3dcd9c3fe992ea9.webm?t=1743408901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/53b3d32ce8c86c7de3dcd9c3fe992ea9.mp4?t=1743408901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0Worldview<br>``Bebe'' is a gluttonous monster, but he doesn't have the strength to fight his prey on his own.<br>Therefore, they ``mimic'' their prey, mix with the herd, and ``predate'' the moment the prey is weakened.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/bae706ab7ea493c8944d1642b0f4d36f.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br><br><br>The prey of this game is &quot;Oni&quot;.<br>&quot;Oni&quot; has strong power that can defeat other creatures with a single blow, and has lived by eating a lot of food.<br>As a result, Bebe has a plump body and is well-nourished.<br>They have low intelligence and are easily angered, and ``Red Oni'' and ``Blue Oni'' often fight each other just because of their color difference.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/06897ce9c221577a78ead0db8553cdc8.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>This work is a game created at Byking Co., Ltd.'s training for new employees.<br>It may not work properly depending on your PC environment.<br>Also, unintended problems may occur in the game.<br>please note that.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>\u25a0What is &quot;Killpaku!&quot;?<br>A 3D action game where you control Bebe, a gluttonous monster.<br>Aim at the weak points of the fighting &quot;onis&quot; and deal the final blow!<br>Literally, enjoy picking the best parts!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/b660bf9e1ff42e2888f6aea01b7ebfc1.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br><br>\u25a0Three types of \u201ccopying\u201d, \u201cpredation\u201d, \u201cstealing\u201d, and \u201cimitation\u201d<br><br>Make full use of the 3 actions to earn more scores within the 3 minute time limit!<br>Eat as much as you can to avoid being defeated and aim for S rank!<br><br>\u25a0The first \u201crip-off\u201d and \u201cpredation\u201d<br>It can extend its tongue to eat weakened prey.<br>There are two ways to eat, one is to eat quickly in a straight line, and the other is to eat in batches while rotating.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046510/extras/8d77f5a80e572a517920df35315ffd0f.poster.avif?t=1743408901\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam